# Generated by cartographer: the index and cache are derived, but the reviewed
# map canon (.anchorage/observations.ndjson) is committed and promoted through
# code review — that is the whole premise of ADR-0043. Ignoring the directory
# wholesale made accepted canon impossible to commit. The per-directory
# .anchorage/.gitignore does the fine-grained split.
